Serialized :rfc:`5545` TEXT values no longer emit control characters such as NUL. Parsing stays open so problematic files can still be read; :class:`~icalendar.prop.text.vText` removes leftover CONTROLs when constructed so both :meth:`~icalendar.prop.text.vText.to_ical` and :meth:`~icalendar.prop.text.vText.to_jcal` stay valid. I used AI to assist me with this change. @Dmao233
